// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2474211900" "I've gotten word from Gordon Bower that several of his citizens have been kidnapped by the Red Caps.  I'm not going to lie to you, {HeroName}.  Those citizens are probably in terrible danger. Most likely they'll wind up dead; at worst, they'll wind up as playthings for the Red Caps for all eternity.  Fortunately, I know where they are. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>And I need you to bring them back.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1571842015" "Bring the captured citizens back"
// SendOffString :
"P361435933" "The Red Caps have taken the kidnapped villagers to the spirit world.  Be careful there, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1657538697" "Escort hostages to safety"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P930499493" "The longer you leave those people in the Red Caps' hands, the less likely you'll get them back in one piece."
// TaskTitle :
"P788998912" "<color deepskyblue>Crossing Over</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2770291627" "<color deepskyblue>Part One</color>"

