"P4119713264" "I think I've uncovered a way to strike at the Red Caps.  It seems they've been hoarding all the iron in the area.  Fey creatures, as I'm sure you know, are afraid of iron.  It can harm them quite grievously. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you would go into the caves and recover their iron hoard, I think we could really hit them where it hurts.</A>"
