// Dialog :
"P2645500075" "Thank you, {HeroName}.  I'll get this iron back to its owners.  Except for this piece.  This blade.  It belonged to my grandfather, you see.  I've kept it as something of a memento, but now I want you to have it, at least for a while.  I can't think of a better use for it than in defense of my grandfather's home."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3157684831" "Exploiting the weaknesses of the Red Caps will be key to defeating them, {HeroName}.  Use that blade well."
// RandomFameString :
"P3682361918" "I saw {HeroName} running around with a new sword."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1845894905" "A friend of mine may be in trouble.  His name's Daschle.  Walter Daschle.  He's a member of MAGI.  Not the most talented mystic you'll ever meet, but very talented when it comes to summoning spells.  Last I heard of him, he was working on ways to summon the varied creatures of Croatoa.  I imagine that's why the Red Caps came after him. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to travel to the spirit realm and bring Daschle back.</A>  He's a good man, and he's in trouble.  It's within the spirit realm.  Now, be careful out there, {HeroName}.  From the intelligence I've received, it sounds like this gathering is truly massive."
// AcceptString :
"P1188570547" "Check out the Red Cap gathering"
// SendOffString :
"P3950057718" "All signs indicate that the Red Caps are increasing their activities.  It could be that they're ready to draw Salamanca into Croatoa permanently."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1076464751" "Seek clues from Red Caps"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3729686204" "I need to find out what's going on at that gathering."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2967923603" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three</color>"

