// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2859190706" "You managed to save Walter Daschle, but it sounds like there are three mystics still in danger. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I've located a large Red Cap ceremony in the spirit world; it seems likely that the mystics are there.</A> Even if they aren't, we're likely to learn something about the Red Caps plans to subsume Salamanca. So, I need you there. Now."
// AcceptString :
"P2903440743" "Break up the Red Cap ceremony"
// SendOffString :
"P1228219623" "The ceremony is taking place in the spirit world. I need to know everything you observe while you're there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2732690444" "Defeat Broadkin & his friends"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3381018642" "If you move quickly, you still have a chance to break up that ceremony."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2753106874" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3855943609" "A gleeful little laugh breaks off into a wicked chortle."
// Script Variable CROATOA_OUTDOORMISSION8_SHAKINGSCAFFOLD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4259426144" "Good and sturdy."
// Script Variable CROATOA_OUTDOORMISSION8_SHAKINGSCAFFOLD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P125440100" "You not spoil my preparations!"
// Script Variable CROATOA_OUTDOORMISSION8_FEY_PLACINGHENGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P266984195" "Salamanca be here soon. And forever."
// Script Variable CROATOA_OUTDOORMISSION8_FEY_PLACINGHENGE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2566663728" "You not break our power!"
// Script Variable CROATOA_REDCAPS_OUTDOORMISSION8_TARGETPRACTICE_OBSERVING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3178241037" "My turn next?"
// Script Variable CROATOA_REDCAPS_OUTDOORMISSION8_TARGETPRACTICE_LOITERING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P754711381" "Bored now. Want Salamancans here soon."
// Script Variable CROATOA_REDCAPS_OUTDOORMISSION8_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3015944274" "When Salamancans stuck here, you be ready for them."
// Script Variable CROATOA_REDCAPS_OUTDOORMISSION8_TARGETPRACTICE_OBSERVING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P472068992" "Oh, boy! Target practice for everyone!"
// Script Variable CROATOA_REDCAPS_OUTDOORMISSION8_TARGETPRACTICE_LOITERING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P264606891" "This a chance to prove your skill!"
// Script Variable CROATOA_REDCAPS_OUTDOORMISSION8_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3998484907" "Hey! You not supposed to be here!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3790123241" "Broadkin"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1303828669" "Good, good, good. We take them soon."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P277049359" "Hah! You lose! Salamanca be ours forever!"

