// Dialog :
"P1951513304" "One of the Red Caps you defeated giggled, 'Ceremony over! We ready now. Salamanca be ours soon!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P680572747" "You defeated the Red Caps, but learned that Salamanca is still in peril."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2343518348" "The mystics weren't there? That's bad. What's worse, it sounds like the Red Caps are ready to suck Salamanca into Croatoa. We have to stop it, {HeroName}. We are officially out of time."
// RandomFameString :
"P19321574" "{HeroName} seems worried about Salamanca."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3418184977" "According to the Red Caps you faced, Salamanca is under attack right now. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get over there and stop it.</A> There are three mystics still under the Red Caps' control: Janet, William, and Gregori. I need you to find them and get them to the village fountain. Once there, they'll start working on a spell to banish the Red Caps from the village. You'll need to protect the henge around the fountain, which keeps the village safe, while the mystics work their magic. Otherwise, the Red Caps may be able to take over Salamanca for good!"
// AcceptString :
"P2138882781" "Stop takeover of Salamanca"
// SendOffString :
"P3628727531" "That henge is the only thing standing between Salamanca and certain destruction. Keep it there, {HeroName}."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P943662255" "That ceremony is still going on!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3701972778" "<color deepskyblue>Part Finale</color>"

